<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Goldman starts long-term care cos.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Goldman starts long-term care cos.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs said analyst Debra Lawson initiated coverage of several long-term health care companies.</p>
<p>-- said initiated coverage of Beverly Enterprises Inc, Vencor Inc, and Healthsouth Corp and added the stocks to its &quot;Recommended List.&quot;</p>
<p>-- said started Genesis Health Ventures Inc as a market outperform.</p>
<p>-- said started Health Care and Retirement and Manor Care Inc with market performer ratings.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
